   - **(Carried, still true)** `mcp__t3-code__preview_resize` times out — use `agent-browser --session <n> set viewport <w> <h>` instead (bare `viewport` is `Unknown command`). `next-themes` here has no `fallback` prop. The Agent tool cannot set reasoning effort; only `Workflow`'s `agent({effort})` can. The harness blocks foreground `sleep` chains, so waits must use `run_in_background: true` or Monitor.

5. **Problem Solving:**

   Every fix was derived from **measurement**, not taste. Chan Dai's live site was driven in a real browser to extract exact geometry before touching our hero:

